	ZH 1:
	'Nothing so formal.'
	R
	'Come here.'
	\L_018da:
	\L_018cd:
	\L_01825:
	ZH 1:
	'...??'
	R
	'Okay... Excuse me.'
	\L_018da:
	\L_018cd:
	\L_01841:
	ZH 1:
	'What could it be...?'
	R
	'Something more secret?'
	\L_018da:
	\L_018cd:
	\L_017ed:
	ZH 1:
	'Despite being told it was'
	R
	'nothing formal, Rick was tense'
	R
	'as he approached Rance.'
	\L_018da:
	\L_018cd:
	\L_017b5:
	ZH 1:
	'So...'
	\L_018da:
	\L_018cd:
	\L_01825:
	ZH 1:
	'Hah...'
	\L_018da:
	\L_018cd:
	\L_017b5:
	ZH 1:
	'Have you and Leila been'
	R
	'getting along well?'
	\L_018da:
	\L_018cd:
	\L_01825:
	ZH 1:
	'Heh...?? Huh...?? Ah... Th-That'
	R
	'certainly... isn’t formal...'
	\L_018da:
	\L_018cd:
	\L_017b5:
	ZH 1:
	'Hey, tell me.'
	R
	'Are you and Leila getting'
	R
	'along well?'
	\L_018da:
	\L_018cd:
	\L_01825:
	ZH 1:
	'W-Well... We have minor'
	R
	'arguments sometimes...'
	\L_018da:
	ZH 1:
	'But our relationship’s more on'
	R
	'the good side... I think...'
	\L_018da:
	\L_018cd:
	\L_017ed:
	ZH 1:
	'Rick blushed.'
	\L_018da:
	\L_018cd:
	\L_017b5:
	ZH 1:
	'Idiot. Nobody cares about that.'
	\L_018da:
	ZH 1:
	'What I want to hear isn’t'
