	'something out of a middle'
	R
	'schooler’s diary.'
	\L_018da:
	ZH 1:
	'Alright, I’ll get right to the'
	R
	'point.'
	\L_018da:
	ZH 1:
	'Have you fucked yet?'
	\L_018da:
	\L_018cd:
	\L_01825:
	ZH 1:
	'Ah...'
	\L_018da:
	\L_018cd:
	\L_017ed:
	ZH 1:
	'Rick’s blush became a deeper'
	R
	'red.'
	\L_018da:
	\L_018cd:
	\L_01825:
	ZH 1:
	'... That’s... We... haven’t done'
