	\L_018cd:
	\L_01825:
	ZH 1:
	'... No...'
	\L_018da:
	\L_018cd:
	\L_017b5:
	ZH 1:
	'Gahahahaha!, oh well.'
	\L_018da:
	ZH 1:
	'You’re older than I am, but I’m'
	R
	'an expert on handling women, so'
	R
	'ask me whatever you want.'
	\L_018da:
	ZH 1:
	'If you want...'
	R
	'I can tell you what Leila’s'
	R
	'weak point is.'
	\L_018da:
	\L_018cd:
	\L_01825:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_018da:
	\L_018cd:
	\L_017ed:
	ZH 1:
	'Rick stiffened.'
