	!VAR0516 : 6!
	\L_01879:
	\L_01825:
	ZH 1:
	'It would be wise not to listen'
	R
	'to everything Bệ hạ Rance says.'
	\L_018da:
	ZH 1:
	'...'
	\L_018da:
	ZH 1:
	'The way the King treats women is'
	R
	'a bit peculiar,'
	\L_018da:
	ZH 1:
	'so it would be better not to'
	R
	'follow his example.'
	\L_018da:
	\L_018cd:
	\L_017b5:
	ZH 1:
	'What’s that...? Are you saying'
	R
	'the way I do things is bad,'
	R
	'Maris?'
	\L_018da:
	\L_018cd:
	\L_01825:
	ZH 1:
	'Well... Oh, I just remembered I'
	R
	'have something I need to go take'
	R
	'care of.'
	\L_018da:
	\L_018cd:
	\L_01887:
	\L_017b5:
	ZH 1:
	'Maaaaaaaris!!'
	\L_018da:
	\L_018cd:
