	ZH 1:
	'　　　Leazas Castle'
	R
	ZM 24:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'　　　　　Audience Room'
	\L_018da:
	ZH 1:
	'Rick appeared before Rance.'
	\L_018da:
	\L_018cd:
	\L_01825:
	ZH 1:
	'You summoned me...?'
	\L_018da:
	\L_018cd:
	\L_017ed:
	ZH 1:
	'Rick’s voice was somewhat'
	R
	'lacking in drive.'
	\L_018da:
	\L_018cd:
	\L_017b5:
	ZH 1:
	'Oh, there you are, Rick.'
	R
	'I’m giving you this today.'
	\L_018da:
	\L_018cd:
	\L_017ed:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance handed a ticket to Rick.'
	\L_018da:
	\L_018cd:
	\L_01825:
	ZH 1:
	'What’s this...?'
	\L_018da:
	\L_018cd:
	\L_017b5:
	ZH 1:
	'Discount ticket for a nearby'
	R
	'image club.'
	\L_018da:
	ZH 1:
	'They’ve got girls that dress up'
	R
	'like my royal guards, and you'
	R
	'can fuck them.'
	\L_018da:
	\L_018cd:
	\L_017ed:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance patted Rick on the'
	R
	'shoulder.'
	\L_018da:
	\L_018cd:
	\L_01825:
	ZH 1:
	'King...'
	\L_018da:
	\L_018cd:
	\L_017b5:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_018da:
	ZH 1:
	'... Uh... I’m sorry about what'
	R
	'happened to Leila...'
	\L_018da:
	ZH 1:
	'But... She’s dead...'
	R
	'All you can do is forget about'
	R
	'her...'
	\L_018da:
	\L_018cd:
	\L_01825:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_018da:
	ZH 1:
	'King, I’m happy that you care.'
	R
	'But...'
	\L_018da:
	\L_018cd:
	\L_017ed:
	ZH 1:
	'Rick gently returned the'
	R
	'ticket to Rance.'
	\L_018da:
	\L_018cd:
	\L_01825:
	ZH 1:
	'I can only accept your'
	R
	'condolences... Excuse me...'
	\L_018da:
	\L_018cd:
	\L_01887:
	\L_017ed:
	ZH 1:
	'So as not to be rude, Rick'
	R
	'took care to bow deeply to'
	R
	'Rance, then walked away.'
	\L_018da:
	\L_018cd:
	\L_017b5:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_018da:
	ZH 1:
	'Ah... Well... If that’s enough'
	R
	'to make him feel better, then'
	R
	'it’s no problem...'
	\L_018da:
	ZH 1:
	'... But... Man... Haah...'
	R
	'Leila...'
	\L_018da:
	ZH 1:
	'When she became Rick’s, I was'
	R
	'able to tolerate it, but...'
	\L_018da:
	ZH 1:
	'If she’s dead, then what was'
	R
	'the point of that...?'
	\L_018da:
	ZH 1:
	'... Damn it... I’m depressed'
	R
	'too...'
	\L_018da:
	ZH 1:
	'Haah... Leila...'
	\L_018da:
	\L_018cd:
	\L_017ed:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance sighed.'
